# Bonus: show accepts tags and an initial commit has no following diff.
> init
<<<
D DATE "Date: \w{3} \w{3} \d{2} \d{2}:\d{2}:\d{2} \d{4} [-+]\d{4}"
> log
===
commit ([a-f0-9]{40})
(Date: \w{3} \w{3} \d{2} \d{2}:\d{2}:\d{2} \d{4} [-+]\d{4})
initial commit

<<<*
D INITIAL "${1}"
D INITIAL_DATE "${2}"
> tag beginning
<<<
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "later"
<<<
> show beginning
===
commit ${INITIAL}
${INITIAL_DATE}
initial commit

<<<
